  },
  "scope_notes": "",
  "changed_since_previous": "Added commit 755a45b95f to delete the temporary `.incomplete` output file on failure using DumptxoutsetGuard, skipping deletion if the target is a FIFO pipe.",
  "card": "This PR updates the `dumptxoutset` RPC to reject stale rollback targets early, prevent concurrent invocations, and clean up temporary files on failure. Currently, rolling back to a stale block triggers an expensive UTXO set duplication and block disconnection loop before erroring out, concurrent calls corrupt shared temporary files and clobber prune locks, and failed runs leave partial files on disk. The change guards against simultaneous runs, validates that the rollback target is in the active chain, and removes incomplete output files if an error occurs.",
